      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At home late at night, Nastya wakes up with a sudden craving, while the next morning in the locker room Senya and Fedya plant a fake mouse in Katya's locker to scare her.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Якорь мне в душу!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Оставила сама, не помню где.",
      "gap": 0.55
